{"id":"n64699-1-16","stage":3,"title":"수천 · 数千","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64699-1-16-1","ko":"우와, 정원에 수천 송이의 장미꽃이 피어 있네.","zh":"哇，花园里开了数千朵玫瑰花呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우와,","meaning":"哇","explanation":"우와：哇","readings":[{"term":"우와","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:우와:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"우와","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"정원에","meaning":"庭院，院子","explanation":"정원：庭院，院子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"정원","audio":"/audio/d5c971809d22cbbd4066.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70889","senseId":"1","lemma":"정원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수천","meaning":"数千，几千","explanation":"수천：数千，几千","readings":[{"term":"수천","audio":"/audio/6b5a31892c2b41ccb71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64699","senseId":"1","lemma":"수천","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"송이의","meaning":"朵，串","explanation":"송이：朵，串；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"송이","audio":"/audio/32e000a4f5d6d6db9622.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63811","senseId":"2","lemma":"송이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장미꽃이","meaning":"玫瑰花","explanation":"장미꽃：玫瑰花；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장미꽃","audio":"/audio/cbf5c1d9bf8a292eb1ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:장미꽃:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"장미꽃","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"피어","meaning":"开","explanation":"피다：开；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"피다","audio":"/audio/aef10307b7c8f7277a07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73270","senseId":"1","lemma":"피다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있네.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2d727fbbe4b971d2","term":"우와","zh":"哇","au