前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오길","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘했어.","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"棒","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得好、优秀。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/979634b39b9606b2785d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.815,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64699","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLe